cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Evaluating the Quality of User Stories: An Extended Comparative Study of Multiple LLMs and Rule-Based Tools - Supplementary Material"
abstract: >
  This repository contains supplementary materials for an extended comparative study
  on automated user story quality evaluation using Large Language Models and the Quality
  User Story (QUS) Framework. It includes datasets of 168 user stories from
  3 open-source projects, evaluation scripts, and analysis results from GPT-5,
  GPT-5-mini, and GPT-4 models.
